        <mxCell id="note1" value="&lt;b&gt;Note:&lt;/b&gt; Services are implemented as stateless Python modules (module-level functions). Classes here represent the logical service layer of backend/app/services/*.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;«PK» = primary key, «unique» = unique index.&lt;br/&gt;JSON-typed columns (summary, findings, flags, events) are stored as TEXT and serialized/deserialized at the router layer." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
